{
    "title": "Valentines love coloring book",
    "description": "Free love and valentines day coloring book. Start relaxing by coloring in one of the many free coloring pages. Or send a beautiful postcard to the person you love on Valentine's Day or as a love letter. Surprise your (secretly) loved one by sending them a romantic Valentine card with custom text, as a Valentine gift straight from your heart!\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc8f There are lots of romantic Valentine themed coloring pages featuring couples hugging and kissing, in love and with hearts. Express your affection through your art and share it with your Valentines, on any day but especially on February 14th!\r\n\r\nIf you are stuck while writing a romantic love letter this love app will help you with color therapy. Color therapy helps you shape your thoughts and let the words flow.\r\nStop writing your love letter to your lover, start coloring cupid right away! \r\n\r\nIf you have doubts, because of heartbreak and you want to say sorry, make a postcard with this app and send it. Maybe then your heartbreak will be solved.... It's (almost) never too late to say sorry! And if things don't go as you expected, re-coloring the drawing will help. This love book will somehow, someday help you!\r\n\r\nIf you are already a little older and don't know how romance works these days, maybe send a love letter, but it will be much easier to use this coloring book of love. Make your own personalized postcard and send it just like a love letter! You never knew you could be so romantic!\r\n\r\nYou don't believe in cupid? Well, I do! Try it again. Make a beautiful drawing and the postcard to your love. If it didn't turn out as expected, just color another one. It's all about color therapy of love.\r\n\r\nDownload this app with hearts and roses coloring pages and start drawing and coloring and share your drawings as valentines or love letters to the one you love. \r\n\r\nWith so many free coloring pages in themes like hearts and cupid.\r\n\r\nAnd once the coloring page is done, you can easily share it with your loved one as a valentine or love letter. And all your creations are saved in this coloring book of love. You can find them again later or send them again in no time. And yes, you can also put a big cross through your saved postcard and send it again. We do not think this is a good plan. It seems better to us that you pick up the phone and personally let him or her know that the wedding is off.\r\n\r\nSo whether you're heartbroken or in a romantic mood, this app will help you create something beautiful!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Free love and valentines day coloring book. Start relaxing by coloring in one of the many free coloring pages. Or send a beautiful postcard to the person you love on Valentine&#39;s Day or as a love letter. Surprise your (secretly) loved one by sending them a romantic Valentine card with custom text, as a Valentine gift straight from your heart!<br><br>\ud83d\udc8f There are lots of romantic Valentine themed coloring pages featuring couples hugging and kissing, in love and with hearts. Express your affection through your art and share it with your Valentines, on any day but especially on February 14th!<br><br>If you are stuck while writing a romantic love letter this love app will help you with color therapy. Color therapy helps you shape your thoughts and let the words flow.<br>Stop writing your love letter to your lover, start coloring cupid right away! <br><br>If you have doubts, because of heartbreak and you want to say sorry, make a postcard with this app and send it. Maybe then your heartbreak will be solved.... It&#39;s (almost) never too late to say sorry! And if things don&#39;t go as you expected, re-coloring the drawing will help. This love book will somehow, someday help you!<br><br>If you are already a little older and don&#39;t know how romance works these days, maybe send a love letter, but it will be much easier to use this coloring book of love. Make your own personalized postcard and send it just like a love letter! You never knew you could be so romantic!<br><br>You don&#39;t believe in cupid? Well, I do! Try it again. Make a beautiful drawing and the postcard to your love. If it didn&#39;t turn out as expected, just color another one. It&#39;s all about color therapy of love.<br><br>Download this app with hearts and roses coloring pages and start drawing and coloring and share your drawings as valentines or love letters to the one you love. <br><br>With so many free coloring pages in themes like hearts and cupid.<br><br>And once the coloring page is done, you can easily share it with your loved one as a valentine or love letter. And all your creations are saved in this coloring book of love. You can find them again later or send them again in no time. And yes, you can also put a big cross through your saved postcard and send it again. We do not think this is a good plan. It seems better to us that you pick up the phone and personally let him or her know that the wedding is off.<br><br>So whether you&#39;re heartbroken or in a romantic mood, this app will help you create something beautiful!",
